# Keep the build context small and reproducible. node_modules in particular must never be copied:
# the image installs its own from the lockfile, and a host tree built for a different platform would
# quietly override it with binaries that cannot run.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
docs
postman
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
.DS_Store
apps/web/dist
